      "parent_id": "section-6dbbd25d0bcb9b848452",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "单节点部署K8S / 调整集群配置 / 调整后的集群配置文件\n# 设置主机防火墙, 放通IP白名单\nufw:\n  enabled: true\n    ipv4:\n  whitelist:\n      - 1.73.6.70/32\n      - 1.73.6.59/32\n      - 1.73.6.60/32\n      - 1.0.144.134/32                   #放通ntp的server ip\n      - 1.0.144.130/32                   #放通ntp的server ip\n    ipv6:\n      - 2408:8142:60ff:fc01:1706:406::/128\n      - 2408:8142:60ff:fc02:1706:406::/128\n# 编译安装ice网卡驱动\nice_driver:\n  enabled: true\n  version: 1.7.16\n# 安装Intel Ethernet Port Configuration Tool\nepct_tool:\n  enabled: true\n  version: 1.39.32.5\n# 启用k8s可选插件, 部分UPF依赖插件已默认启用\naddons:\n  sealos: 4.3.7\n  kubernetes:\n    image: docker.io/labring/kubernetes:v1.25.11-4.3.3\n  network_plugin:\n    image: docker.io/labring/calico:v3.26.1",
